<title>USA: PHLX to list options on Choice Hotels.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list options on Choice Hotels.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said Tuesday it would list options on Choice Hotels Holdings Inc on November 4.</p>
<p>The PHLX said the optins would have opening strike prices of 12-1/2, 15 and 17-1/2. Initial expirations will be in November, December, January and April.</p>
<p>Spear, Leeds &amp; Kellogg will be the specialist unit.</p>
<p>--Derivatives desk, (312) 408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
